## Pipeline Overview
```
Raw FASTQ files
      │
      ▼
Quality Control (FastQC → MultiQC)
      │
      ▼
Adapter Trimming (Trim Galore)
      │
      ├──────────────────────────────┐
      ▼                              ▼
DNA Methylation                  RNA-seq
Alignment (Bismark → hg38)       Alignment (STAR → hg38)
      │                              │
      ▼                              ▼
Methylation Extraction           Read Counting (featureCounts)
      │                              │
      ▼                              ▼
Differential Methylation         Differential Expression
(methylKit / DSS)                (DESeq2)
      │                              │
      └──────────────┬───────────────┘
                     ▼
             Integration Analysis
         (DMR–DEG overlap, pathway
          enrichment, clusterProfiler)
```

