## How to Run

### 1. Clone the repository
```bash
git clone https://github.com/yourusername/sma_epigenomics_pipeline.git
cd sma_epigenomics_pipeline
```

### 2. Set up the environment
```bash
conda env create -f envs/environment.yml
conda activate sma_epigenomics_pipeline
```

### 3. Add raw data
Place raw FASTQ files in `data/raw/` and make them read-only:
```bash
chmod -R 444 data/raw/
```

### 4. Run the pipeline
```bash
# Dry run first — checks everything without executing
snakemake -n

# Full run
snakemake --cores 8
```

